          "title": "You'll want to know: كشف",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كشف — kashafa — \"to uncover, to reveal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كشف التحقيق سبب الحريق. kashafa at-taḥqīq sabab al-ḥarīq. The investigation revealed the cause of the fire."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يكشف, yakshif."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كشف (kashafa) عن: to disclose. A medical check-up is كشف (kashafa) طبي."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كشف (kashafa) is built on the native Arabic root k-sh-f (Lane), \"to take away a covering from a thing\"."
            }
          ]
        },
